ise \u0026 Recap | Course Resources \u0026 Community | Understanding Python Environments | Understanding Python Packages \u0026 Pip | Creating Virtual Environments (venv) | A Note on Anaconda | Installing Python Packages (pip install) | Using Python Packages (Import) | Interactive Python with Jupyter | Full Setup Recap \u0026 Exercise | What is Programming? | Understanding Python Syntax \u0026 PEP8 | Understanding \u0026 Debugging Errors | Variables | Comments | Data Types Introduction | Numbers (Integers \u0026 Floats) | Strings | String Formatting (F strings) | String Methods | Booleans | Operators (Arithmetic, Comparison, Logical) | Shortcut Assignments (+=) | Control Flow Introduction | Conditional Statements (if, elif, else) | Loops (For Loops \u0026 range()) | Data Structures Introduction | Lists | Dictionaries | Tuples | Sets | Functions (Defining \u0026 Calling) | Function Parameters \u0026 Arguments | Global vs Local Variable Scope | Returning Values from Functions | External Tools (Modules, Packages) | Importing Modules \u0026 Built ins | Import Methods Summary | Installing Packages \u0026 requirements.txt | Working with APIs (Requests Example) | Working with Data Example (Pandas \u0026 Matplotlib) | Reading \u0026 Saving Data Files | Practical Python Introduction | Project Structure \u0026 Organization | Understanding File Paths | Working with Different File Types | Organizing Code into Modules | Error Handling (Try/Except) | Introduction to Classes (OOP) | Creating Your First Class (__init__, self) | Class Attributes vs Instances | Class Methods | Class Inheritance | When to Use Classes vs Functions | Introduction to Git \u0026 GitHub | Git Fundamentals | Installing Git | Basic Git Workflow | GitHub Account Setup \u0026 Authentication | Cloning GitHub Repositories | Creating Repositories \u0026 .gitignore | Using Git with VS Code UI | Environment Variables \u0026 Secrets (.env) | Using python dotenv Package | Introduction to Ruff (Linter \u0026 Formatter) | Setting Up Ruff in VS Code | Ruff in Action | Introduction to Uv (Modern Package Manager) | Installing Uv | Using Uv (uv init, add, sync) | Complete Python Project Workflow Exercise | Course Wrap up \u0026 What's Next"}]},"collapsedThumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ygXn5nV5qFc/hqdefault_11966.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEnCNACELwBSFryq4qpAxkIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAG4AvMY\u0026rs=AOn4CLDv7pF46KnpRYcDgc6cOsy428Kz7Q","width":336,"height":188}]},"collapsedLabel":{"runs":[{"text":"84"},{"text":" chapters"}]},"expandedTitle":{"runs":[{"text":"84"},{"text":" chapters in this video"}]},"showLeadingCollapsedLabel":true},"expandedContent":{"horizontalCardListRenderer":{"cards":[{"macroMarkersListItemRenderer":{"title":{"runs":[{"text":"Introduction: Learn Python for AI"}]},"timeDescription":{"runs":[{"text":"0:00"}]},"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ygXn5nV5qFc/hqdefault_11966.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEnCNACELwBSFryq4qpAxkIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAG4AvMY\u0026rs=AOn4CLDv7pF46KnpRYcDgc6cOsy428Kz7Q","width":336,"height":188}]},"onTap":{"clickTrackingParams":"CNcBENDQBhgAIhMIraCXh6PGlwMVkoXYBR262CfyygEEScoT4Q==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/watch?v=ygXn5nV5qFc","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_WATCH","rootVe":3832}},"watchEndpoint":{"videoId":"ygXn5nV5qFc","watchEndpointSupportedOnesieConfig":{"html5PlaybackOnesieConfig":{"commonConfig":{"url":"https://rr3---sn-gwpa-qxaer.googlevideo.com/initplayback?source=youtube\u0026oeis=1\u0026c=WEB\u0026oad=3200\u0026ovd=3200\u0026oaad=11000\u0026oavd=11000\u0026ocs=700\u0026oewis=1\u0026oputc=1\u0026msp=1\u0026odepv=1\u0026id=ca05e7e67579a857\u0026ip=157.49.15.193\u0026initcwndbps=1063250\u0026mt=1792418992\u0026oweuc="}}}}},"trackingParams":"CNcBENDQBhgAIhMIraCXh6PGlwMVkoXYBR262Cfy","layout":"MACRO_MARKERS_LIST_ITEM_RENDERER_LAYOUT_VERTICAL","isHighlighted":false}},{"macroMarkersListItemRenderer":{"title":{"runs":[{"text":"Course Overview \u0026 Structure"}]},"timeDescription":{"runs":[{"tex